[33.548, "o", "\u001b[7mhead -20 README.md\u001b[27m"]
[0.290, "o", "\u001b[18D\u001b[27mh\u001b[27me\u001b[27ma\u001b[27md\u001b[27m \u001b[27m-\u001b[27m2\u001b[27m0\u001b[27m \u001b[27mR\u001b[27mE\u001b[27mA\u001b[27mD\u001b[27mM\u001b[27mE\u001b[27m.\u001b[27mm\u001b[27md\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n"]
[0.010, "o", "# Autonomous Dev Agent\r\n\r\nAn AI agent system that autonomously fixes software bugs — from a plain-English\r\nissue description to a tested, reviewed code patch — using a multi-agent pipeline\r\nwith self-correction and persistent memory.\r\n\r\n## Why this exists\r\n\r\nMost \"AI coding demo\" projects are a single LLM call that writes code once and\r\nhopes for the best. This project is different: it's built around a **feedback\r\nloop**. If a fix breaks a test, the agent sees the failure and tries again\r\n(up to a capped number of retries) instead of giving up or silently failing.\r\nA separate reviewer agent then checks the diff for things tests don't catch —\r\nstyle, missed edge cases, security smells — before anything is considered done.\r\n\r\n## Architecture\r\n\r\n1. **Planner agent** — takes an issue description, produces a structured plan\r\n   (root cause hypothesis, files to touch, ordered subtasks)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "2. **Coder agent** — reads relevant files and writes a patch, using tool calls\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[7m%\u001b[27m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m                                                                                                        \r \r"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b]7;file://Mac.lan/Users/vishalkishorekumar/Desktop/autonomous-dev-agent\u0007"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[0m\u001b[27m\u001b[24m\u001b[Jvishalkishorekumar@Mac autonomous-dev-agent % \u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[27.368, "o", "\u001b[7mpython3 - << 'EOF'\u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[7mwith open(\"README.md\") as f:\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7m    content = f.read()\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mmarker = \"## Architecture\"\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mdemo_section = \"\"\"## Demo\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01b610da-8ec0-40ae-a503-2abd38c42020\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mThe full pipeline running end-to-end against a 7-issue benchmark: issue in,\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mplan produced, code written, tested inside an isolated Docker sandbox,\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mreviewed, and a final success-rate summary printed out.\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7m\"\"\"\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mcontent = content.replace(marker, demo_section + marker, 1)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mwith open(\"README.md\", \"w\") as f:\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7m    f.write(content)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mprint(\"Done\")\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mEOF\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[0.329, "o", "\u001b[21A\u001b[43C\u001b[27mp\u001b[27my\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mh\u001b[27mo\u001b[27mn\u001b[27m3\u001b[27m \u001b[27m-\u001b[27m \u001b[27m<\u001b[27m<\u001b[27m \u001b[27m'\u001b[27mE\u001b[27mO\u001b[27mF\u001b[27m'\u001b[1B\r\u001b[27mw\u001b[27mi\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mh\u001b[27m \u001b[27mo\u001b[27mp\u001b[27me\u001b[27mn\u001b[27m(\u001b[27m\"\u001b[27mR\u001b[27mE\u001b[27mA\u001b[27mD\u001b[27mM\u001b[27mE\u001b[27m.\u001b[27mm\u001b[27md\u001b[27m\"\u001b[27m)\u001b[27m \u001b[27ma\u001b[27ms\u001b[27m \u001b[27mf\u001b[27m:\u001b[1B\r\u001b[27m \u001b[27m \u001b[27m \u001b[27m \u001b[27mc\u001b[27mo\u001b[27mn\u001b[27mt\u001b[27me\u001b[27mn\u001b[27mt\u001b[27m \u001b[27m=\u001b[27m \u001b[27mf\u001b[27m.\u001b[27mr\u001b[27me\u001b[27ma\u001b[27md\u001b[27m(\u001b[27m)\u001b[2B\r\u001b[27mm\u001b[27ma\u001b[27mr\u001b[27mk\u001b[27me\u001b[27mr\u001b[27m \u001b[27m=\u001b[27m \u001b[27m\"\u001b[27m#\u001b[27m#\u001b[27m \u001b[27mA\u001b[27mr\u001b[27mc\u001b[27mh\u001b[27mi\u001b[27mt\u001b[27me\u001b[27mc\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mu\u001b[27mr\u001b[27me\u001b[27m\"\u001b[1B\r\u001b[27md\u001b[27me\u001b[27mm\u001b[27mo\u001b[27m_\u001b[27ms\u001b[27me\u001b[27mc\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mi\u001b[27mo\u001b[27mn\u001b[27m \u001b[27m=\u001b[27m \u001b[27m\"\u001b[27m\"\u001b[27m\"\u001b[27m#\u001b[27m#\u001b[27m \u001b[27mD\u001b[27me\u001b[27mm\u001b[27mo\u001b[2B\r\u001b[27mh\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mp\u001b[27ms\u001b[27m:\u001b[27m/\u001b[27m/\u001b[27mg\u001b[27mi\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mh\u001b[27mu\u001b[27mb\u001b[27m.\u001b[27mc\u001b[27mo\u001b[27mm\u001b[27m/\u001b[27mu\u001b[27ms\u001b[27me\u001b[27mr\u001b[27m-\u001b[27ma\u001b[27mt\u001b[27mt\u001b[27ma\u001b[27mc\u001b[27mh\u001b[27mm\u001b[27me\u001b[27mn\u001b[27mt\u001b[27ms\u001b[27m/\u001b[27ma\u001b[27ms\u001b[27ms\u001b[27me\u001b[27mt\u001b[27ms\u001b[27m/\u001b[27m0\u001b[27m1\u001b[27m"]
